bsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m brand new to the forum, my fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at the Halcyon resort in June 2015.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any fellow brides out there, would be great to swab ideas and get tips x&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852061,"PostDate":1401012324,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm brand new to the forum, my fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at the Halcyon resort in June 2015.<\/p>\n<p>Any fellow brides out there, would be great to swab ideas and get tips x<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kayrainbow@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"82.37.161.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401011552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MissRainbow","Id":278106,"Name":"MissRainbow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.54.72.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77135,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0d4f9345ad2374126592d94d8116229","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome to the site! You&#039;ll definitely find a ton of information here that will help you plan your DW! I would suggest checking the different reviews available and search the different forums for topics you might be interested in. You&#039;ve picked a beautiful place to get married!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852087,"PostDate":1401053449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome to the site! You'll definitely find a ton of information here that will help you plan your DW! I would suggest checking the different reviews available and search the different forums for topics you might be interested in. You've picked a beautiful place to get married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.71.237.188","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77135,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5aa3108cbe802d3a5637c03c2b4a5a1","RawContent":"@[member=\"MissRainbow\"] If you are still lookingfor a photographer for your wedding, I highly recommend The Memory Factory. They are destination wedding photographers and travel panywhere. We got married in December and we contracted them for the entire event. They photographed our welcome party and our wedding day. They were fantastic and very reasonable. You can contact them at thememoryfactory@hotmail.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1853089,"PostDate":1401623043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278106\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278106-missrainbow\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MissRainbow<\/span><\/a> If you are still lookingfor a photographer for your wedding, I highly recommend The Memory Factory. They are destination wedding photographers and travel panywhere. We got married in December and we contracted them for the entire event. They photographed our welcome party and our wedding day. They were fantastic and very reasonable. You can contact them at thememoryfactory@hotmail.com\u00a0\u00a0\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joannaandwilson2013@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.71.237.188","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369766483,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270067.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":183,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoWil JoWil","Id":270067,"Name":"JoWil JoWil","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.102.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77135,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c0f81b1fbb2d6e1d03d2926862c775e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi MissRainbow,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re getting married at the Sandals Grande St. Lucian in January 2015 - just starting with the planning :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853177,"PostDate":1401644790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi MissRainbow,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're getting married at the Sandals Grande St. Lucian in January 2015 - just starting with the planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sommer.stewart@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.102.47","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401577634,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"scs013115","Id":278185,"Name":"scs013115","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.83.72.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77135,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61538c165d0c6a1325ea36c48dab746e","RawContent":"hi! we&#039;re getting married Aug 15 at the grande st lucian. we vacationed there 3 years ago and had the best time ever.  since then we&#039;ve been on 5 other vacations and when it came time to pick our destination wedding (actually we&#039;re eloping) we couldn&#039;t think of anywhere else under a 10 hr flight time that we&#039;d even consider!\n\nwhat has the planning process been like for you? the resort is amazing and the staff is too but im feeling like they&#039;re falling short on reasonable options to make the day what I want it to be. I feel like EVERYTHING is either not allowed or costs extra.","Attachments":[],"Id":1856833,"PostDate":1403646695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hi! we're getting married Aug 15 at the grande st lucian. we vacationed there 3 years ago and had the best time ever.  since then we've been on 5 other vacations and when it came time to pick our destination wedding (actually we're eloping) we couldn't think of anywhere else under a 10 hr flight time that we'd even consider!<br>\nwhat has the planning process been like for you? the resort is amazing and the staff is too but im feeling like they're falling short on reasonable options to make the day what I want it to be. I feel like EVERYTHING is either not allowed or costs extra. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yrbabygirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.83.72.26","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402876694,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yrbabygirl","Id":278520,"Name":"yrbabygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.7.68.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77135,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by megthomson, 07 September 2014 - 10:14 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1410128056,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"927718c7bb236bc29a67fad36de154ca","RawContent":"\n\nHi!  We are looking to book our honeymoon at Halcyon in February 2015...almost set to book it.  Getting married at Beaches Turks &amp;amp; Caicos in December!  If we book I&#039;m more than happy to take tons of pics for you there!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1870974,"PostDate":1410127656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br>\nHi!  We are looking to book our honeymoon at Halcyon in February 2015...almost set to book it.  Getting married at Beaches Turks & Caicos in December!  If we book I'm more than happy to take tons of pics for you there!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megthomson78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.76.163.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388735198,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275858.jpg?_r=1394079727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megthomson","Id":275858,"Name":"megthomson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.46.224.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77135,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b0977975f902f0ce03a8dd857973a74","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just returned from our wedding at the Grande St. Lucian - let me know if you still have any questions and I&#039;ll do my best to help!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886093,"PostDate":1423669631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just returned from our wedding at the Grande St. Lucian - let me know if you still have any questions and I'll do my best to help!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sommer.stewart@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.102.47","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401577634,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"scs013115","Id":278185,"Name":"scs013115","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77135","Title":"Any Sandals St Lucia Brides Here?","LastPostDate":1423669631},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
