Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":121,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1889339,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282429,"Name":"JanelleAdams","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282429.jpg?_r=1426470959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1426447990,"LastPoster":{"Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1426540399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1889339,"PostDate":1426447990,"PostContent":"Hi all!! I'm new here and am needing all the help and advice I can get. I feel like this was supp...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadams22@live.ca","IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426441823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282429.jpg?_r=1426470959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanelleAdams","Id":282429,"Name":"JanelleAdams","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78907,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab97f6296c52a0e26e699fa95c44a7b2","RawContent":"Hi all!! I&#039;m new here and am needing all the help and advice I can get. I feel like this was supposed to be easier than a traditional wedding but now I&#039;m not so sure. When we decided to go ahead and plan a beach wedding I had all these fabulous ideas and because of costs I feel like everything I wanted isn&#039;t going to be possible. I understand compromise but yeesh I feel every detail I&#039;m having to compromise on :( \n\n\nMy dream wedding is on a picturesque beach just before sundown, a lovely spa like resort, with lush grounds and gardens with a fun staff and atmosphere. \n\n\nWe are traveling with all ages so a family friendly resort is a must. My daughters love swimming in the ocean so a nice calm beach is a MUST as they prefer that over a pool and so do I. The resorts I&#039;ve fallen in love with are way above our price limit, we want guests to come hahaha. \n\n\nIf anyone reading this can guide me in any way I&#039;d really appreciate it as I&#039;m more confused now than ever :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1889339,"PostDate":1426447990,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi all!! I'm new here and am needing all the help and advice I can get. I feel like this was supposed to be easier than a traditional wedding but now I'm not so sure. When we decided to go ahead and plan a beach wedding I had all these fabulous ideas and because of costs I feel like everything I wanted isn't going to be possible. I understand compromise but yeesh I feel every detail I'm having to compromise on <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> <br><br>\nMy dream wedding is on a picturesque beach just before sundown, a lovely spa like resort, with lush grounds and gardens with a fun staff and atmosphere. <br><br>\nWe are traveling with all ages so a family friendly resort is a must. My daughters love swimming in the ocean so a nice calm beach is a MUST as they prefer that over a pool and so do I. The resorts I've fallen in love with are way above our price limit, we want guests to come hahaha. <br><br>\nIf anyone reading this can guide me in any way I'd really appreciate it as I'm more confused now than ever <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadams22@live.ca","IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426441823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282429.jpg?_r=1426470959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanelleAdams","Id":282429,"Name":"JanelleAdams","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78907,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, Yesterday, 07:43 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1426448606,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e251a670e1462f77873e52c861966876","RawContent":"Welcome and congrats. I&#039;m partial to the resort I just married at hehe. Maybe check it out - grand sirenis riviera maya or Mayan beach.  It&#039;s decent for price and it also has very reasonably priced wedding packages and extras   Good luck! \n\n\nOops maybe you are looking at the DR! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889340,"PostDate":1426448438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Welcome and congrats. I'm partial to the resort I just married at hehe. Maybe check it out - grand sirenis riviera maya or Mayan beach.  It's decent for price and it also has very reasonably priced wedding packages and extras   Good luck! <br><br>\nOops maybe you are looking at the DR! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78907,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c60b3b7436d47f8744205edb9ab1821b","RawContent":"I will thank you :) I live in Olds so close to Calgary do you have a travel agent you used whom was able to help you out?","Attachments":[],"Id":1889342,"PostDate":1426450281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I will thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I live in Olds so close to Calgary do you have a travel agent you used whom was able to help you out?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadams22@live.ca","IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426441823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282429.jpg?_r=1426470959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanelleAdams","Id":282429,"Name":"JanelleAdams","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78907,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"303511167640e6f263ea5b647dd3e594","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JanelleAdams\" post=\"1889342\" timestamp=\"1426468281\"]\nI will thank you :) I live in Olds so close to Calgary do you have a travel agent you used whom was able to help you out?[\/quote]I do. She&#039;s in BC. I contacted so many and went into so many offices and she was the only one who helped! :) I can send you her info thru PM. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889344,"PostDate":1426450900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JanelleAdams, on Yesterday, 08:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I will thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I live in Olds so close to Calgary do you have a travel agent you used whom was able to help you out?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI do. She's in BC. I contacted so many and went into so many offices and she was the only one who helped! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I can send you her info thru PM. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78907,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c44ced15d775e0fff8be0e621603f1cd","RawContent":"I have not set on a specific location as of yet, my parents are going to Punta Cana to scope things out for me but I&#039;m still stuck on Cancun and the Mayan.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889353,"PostDate":1426453809,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have not set on a specific location as of yet, my parents are going to Punta Cana to scope things out for me but I'm still stuck on Cancun and the Mayan. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadams22@live.ca","IpAddress":"162.252.47.153","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426441823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282429.jpg?_r=1426470959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanelleAdams","Id":282429,"Name":"JanelleAdams","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.53.12.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78907,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa291b05e0bb9c402dd8f04ec1a55a35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome! Planning a destination wedding is a lot harder than we all expect.. that&#039;s for sure, but it get&#039;s easier once you pick the resort :) It&#039;s always super confusing when you have so many options and haven&#039;t decided where to book. This forum is really awesome and will help you a lot with your planning. The ladies here are really supportive!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889357,"PostDate":1426454429,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome! Planning a destination wedding is a lot harder than we all expect.. that's for sure, but it get's easier once you pick the resort <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It's always super confusing when you have so many options and haven't decided where to book. This forum is really awesome and will help you a lot with your planning. The ladies here are really supportive!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1425000950","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.111.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78907,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Today, 03:41 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1426520492,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abbef28aeb7cce4ca4ec3ceddfe1a200","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum JanelleAdams, and congrats on your upcoming destination wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since a picture is worth a thousand words, here are a few visuals showing the beauty of our Mexican Mayan Riviera - to show you what backdrops they&#039;d make for your wedding photos.....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This example from our recent &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153058061334487.1073741919.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10955789_10153058069679487_5709901704532276152_o.jpg\" alt=\"10955789_10153058069679487_5709901704532\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...or this one from a recent cenote &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153148760879487.1073741923.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Jungle Trash The Dress Session:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/1548081_10153148771289487_8143447399344315780_o.jpg\" alt=\"1548081_10153148771289487_81434473993443\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and here&#039;s one Linc captured at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152904409984487.1073741915.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Secrets Silversand Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10848847_10152904416339487_6789779795916307495_o.jpg\" alt=\"10848847_10152904416339487_6789779795916\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy research and all the best with your plans, cheers! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889473,"PostDate":1426520161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum JanelleAdams, and congrats on your upcoming destination wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since a picture is worth a thousand words, here are a few visuals showing the beauty of our Mexican Mayan Riviera - to show you what backdrops they'd make for your wedding photos.....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This example from our recent <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153058061334487.1073741919.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album<\/a>:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10955789_10153058069679487_5709901704532276152_o.jpg\" alt=\"10955789_10153058069679487_5709901704532\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...or this one from a recent cenote <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153148760879487.1073741923.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Jungle Trash The Dress Session:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/1548081_10153148771289487_8143447399344315780_o.jpg\" alt=\"1548081_10153148771289487_81434473993443\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and here's one Linc captured at <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152904409984487.1073741915.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Secrets Silversand Wedding Album<\/a>:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10848847_10152904416339487_6789779795916307495_o.jpg\" alt=\"10848847_10152904416339487_6789779795916\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy research and all the best with your plans, cheers! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78907,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43172d2c0973518109683f79985405bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Riu Caribe or Riu Cancun are both priced very decently and have great wedding pacakges.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889478,"PostDate":1426523444,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Riu Caribe or Riu Cancun are both priced very decently and have great wedding pacakges.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424096250,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1426540399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"78907","Title":"New Bride 2016","LastPostDate":1426523444},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
