{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":34,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1404,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1885327,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281922,"Name":"AliciaW","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281922.jpg?_r=1424557167","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1423141105,"LastPoster":{"Id":281731,"Name":"eeisner","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":0,"PostDate":0,"PostContent":"","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"","IpAddress":"","GroupId":0,"GroupName":"","JoinDate":0,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":null,"PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"","Id":0,"Name":"","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"17.218.239.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":false,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":78741,"EditedBy":null,"EditDate":0,"EditReason":null,"DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee763b41451597e85b09df69ebb03a25","RawContent":"","Attachments":[],"Id":1889488,"PostDate":1426528121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nattiegams325, on 05 February 2015 - 09:23 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281922\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281922-aliciaw\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AliciaW<\/span><\/a> Congratulations! A wedding can be expensive or affordable anywhere you decide to get married. A misconception that I've come to realize that having a wedding in Mexico is going to be cheaper. Definitely not true. Especially when you start to add up extras and if you have more than 15 or 20 guests (the average covered in a wedding package), the price adds up very quickly. <br><br><br>\nAlso depending on when you want your wedding \u2013 if you decide to come during the high season you should expect to pay more but have a really good chance at good weather. Versus the low season, the fall, prices will be cheaper but there's a higher chance that you'll have rain on your wedding day. <br><br><br>\nI would definitely get a travel agent to start. They can give you some great recommendations on hotels. Also start thinking about the kind of hotel you want and the size of your wedding. All-inclusive like dreams, palace, Iberostars, Barcelo vs non AI like Rosewood\/Banyan tree mayakoba. Adults only or family friendly? Church ceremony or beach? What is important to you \u2013 a good night life such as in downtown Cancun or Playa del Carmen, more rustic Mexico like Tulum, a good beach? Also think about distance from the airport. A hotel in Cancun is a 10 minute drive, versus the Barcelo complex is an hour and a half south and Tulum even farther.<br><br><br>\nIn my opinion, choosing the resort is the most stressful part. After that, it's all fun :-) good luck and don't hesitate with any questions!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"esthereisner@optonline.net","IpAddress":"24.184.196.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421272632,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"eeisner","Id":281731,"Name":"eeisner","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"78741","Title":"Newbie Here! Average Mexico Wedding Costs?","LastPostDate":1426528121},"Pages":null,"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
